ose check or money order\ncovering amount of tickets wanted\nBE SURE OF A GOOD SEAT-ORDER TICKETS IN ADVANCE!\nWISCONSIN AUTO RACING, INCORPORATED\nPhone: EVergreen 4-2240\n1 200 South 1 st Street\nMilwaukee 4, Wisconsin\nAll Reserved Seat Ticket Prices for ALL RACES Are the Same for ADULTS AND CHILDREN\nThirty\n200 MILE STOCK CAR RACE\n\n=== COLUMN 2 ===\nMILT CURCIO\nRacine, Wis.\nMilt made his first appearance in late model\nCTION\nKING\nstock cars here in the July 15 200 mile late model\nstock car race but was forced out at 59 miles with\na cracked motor block. At 39, Milt has been racing\nmotorcycles, modified stocks, and late model\nstocks since he was 16 years old. Worst in-\njury in racing was in a cycle race. Easy style of\ndriving fools a lot of people. In his first eight\nraces this year on the USAC circuit, Milt finished\nno worse than eighth in any of them.\nTROY RUTTMAN\nDearborn, Mich.\nHere's another former 500 mile Indianapolis\nwinner who's active in stock car racing. Won the\n1952 Hoosier Classic at the young age of 21. Racing\ncareer started in 1946 in hot rods. Has competed\nmany times in big cars and late model stocks. \"Won\na 150 miler here in July, 1956 with the powerhouse\nMercury team that included Sam Hanks and\nJimmy Bryan.\n1\nAL KRAUSE PHOTOS\nHambeau\n-\nMOTOR REPAIRS\n—Factory Authorized Service—\nMILWAUKEE 12, WISCONSIN\n245 E. KEEFE AVENUE\nCOncord 4-9300\nD\nHambeau\nCLINTON\nBRIGGS&STRATTON\nENGINES\na23\nOUTBOARD MOTORS\nThirty-one\n200 MILE STOCK CAR RACE","ocr_json":{"space":"normalized","source":"prepared_image","image_sha256":"6d0b804209197cf148c12e27e28fa8fe091b8b902e68c32155ac7de94bc1624a","lines":[{"t":"MILT CURCIO","x":0.769583,"y":0.054974,"w":0.065,"h":0.01767,"s":0.9945},{"t":"Racine, Wis.","x":0.770417,"y":0.073298,"w":0.06125,"h":0.013743,"s":0.9945},{"t":"1962 - AUT0 RACE SCHEDULE - 1962","x":0.105833,"y":0.087696,"w":0.2925,"h":0.021597,"s":0.9426},{"t":"CTION","x":0.618333,"y":0.097513,"w":0.01625,"h":0.009162,"s